  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the establishment and development of the global alliance on artificial intelligence for industry and manufacturing centre of excellence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Artificial intelligence (AI) has emerged as a transformative technology that has the potential to revolutionize the way industries operate. AI can enable machines to perform tasks that require human intelligence, such as perception, reasoning, learning, and decision-making. AI technologies are already being used in various applications in industry and manufacturing, such as predictive maintenance, quality control, supply chain optimization, and process automation. However, the adoption of AI technologies in industry and manufacturing is still in its early stages, and many challenges need to be addressed to fully realize its potential.  The proposed project is aimed at establishing the Global Alliance on Artificial Intelligence for Industry and Manufacturing Centre of Excellence (AIM Global CoE) to support the development, deployment, and scaling-up of AI technologies in industry and manufacturing. The AIM Global CoE will be established in collaboration with government departments, industry partners, and academic institutions, and will serve as a platform for sharing best practices, knowledge, and resources on AI for industry and manufacturing.</narrative>
  </description>
